    }
  ],
  "process_recommendations": [
    "Phase 1 \u2013 Dry Blend: Combine refined cane sugar, fava bean protein isolate, Dutch processed cocoa powder, natural sea salt, chewing gum emulsifier, ammonium phosphatides, and natural chocolate flavor in a high\u2011speed mixer until a homogeneous dry mass is achieved.",
    "Phase 2 \u2013 Melt and Mix: Melt high\u2011oleic sunflower oil in a temperature\u2011controlled vessel, then gradually incorporate the dry blend while maintaining continuous agitation to ensure uniform fat dispersion and prevent clumping.",
    "Phase 3 \u2013 Molding and Cooling: Transfer the molten mixture into chocolate bar molds, allow it to set at ambient temperature, then perform a controlled cooling step to achieve the desired texture before demolding and packaging."
  ],
